ient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><base href=\"https://neuform.ai/pages/change-texts-names-numbers-only-make-the-ui-20260309173822877-pn5z-prompt-remix-20260310123416834-zoab/index.html\">\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nature's Hideaways</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0A1118] text-slate-300 font-sans antialiased relative selection:bg-teal-900 selection:text-teal-50 overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Container Lines Directive -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-between max-w-[1400px] mx-auto w-full z-50 mix-blend-screen opacity-30 hidden md:flex\">\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-white/10 relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-8 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-white/30 bg-[#0A1118]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-white/30 bg-[#0A1118]\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-white/10 relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-8 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-white/30 bg-[#0A1118]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-white/30 bg-[#0A1118]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"relative min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex flex-col overflow-hidden pb-12\">\n            <!-- Background Image -->\n            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506278940547-8a7b59598072?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyNXx8bG9kZ2V8ZW58MXwwfHx8MTc3MzExNzQwMHww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=3840&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Misty Forest Cabin\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center z-[-2] scale-105\" style=\"filter: brightness(0.6) contrast(1.1) saturate(0.8);\">\n\n            <!-- WebGL Simulated Line Overlay (Preserved from source) -->\n            <canvas id=\"hero-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-[-1] opacity-30 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Gradients for text readability and transition -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[-1]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(10,17,24,0.8) 0%, rgba(10,17,24,0.2) 50%, rgba(10,17,24,0.4) 100%);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-64 z-[-1]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, #0A1118);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Header Navigation -->\n            <header class=\"relative z-20 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-6 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white font-medium\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-amber-500\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span>WoodNest</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-white/80\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Locations</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:te