nt-medium\">from 1,800+ stays</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right: Booking Card with Border Gradient Directive -->\n                <div class=\"w-full max-w-md lg:w-[420px] shrink-0\">\n                    <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%);\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#0F1720]/80 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-[calc(1.5rem-1px)] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col gap-6 w-full h-full shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden\">\n                            <!-- Subtle inner glow -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start gap-4\">\n                                <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-medium text-white tracking-tight leading-snug\">Evergreen<br>Pine Family Lodge</h2>\n                                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors shrink-0\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Date Selection -->\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-2\">\n                                <button class=\"flex items-center justify-between bg-black/40 border border-white/5 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-line